    "title": "The 'perfect political storm' that brought down Jimmy Gomez - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Monica Rodriguez ,\n16 hours ago\nA “perfect political storm” helped bring down longtime incumbent Jimmy Gomez, who lost his 34th Congressional District seat to Highland Park political newcomer Angela Gonzales-Torres. Tuesday’s election unfolded amid a shift to the left among some Eastside voters, anti-Trump sentiment and criticism of Gomez over his support for...\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
